      "heroBadge": "January 16–17, 2027",
      "heroTitle": "SEAMUN I Conference",
      "heroTagline": "Policies with a Purpose",
      "heroAudience": "A mid- and high school conference (grades 7–12)",
      "heroLead": "A student-led, non-profit Model UN conference focused on global healthcare and sustainability. Join 200 delegates, 22 chairs, and 10 committees for two days of policy-driven debate. 100% of surplus is donated to the Thai Red Cross Society.",
